<fw type="catch" place="bottom">§. 27.<lb/>
</fw>
<pb n="31" facs="#f0034"/>
</div> <div n="2"> <head>§. 27.<lb/>
</head> <p>Al&#x017F;o auch konnten in den Schriften des<lb/>
